    <string name="race_description_dworv">The Grimnir, known as the Stonewrought, are a hardy and resilient race of beings with an innate connection to the earth.</string>
    <string name="race_description_faun">The Verdani, also known as the Bloomkin, are a playful and mischievous race of creatures that dwell in the wilds of Morkahja's hills and valleys.</string>
    <string name="race_description_fae">The Aevis, known as the Windweavers, are an ethereal race of beings whose origins are deeply intertwined with the element of air.</string>
    <string name="race_description_giant">The Rokur, also known as the Embersworn, are an imposing and powerful race of beings whose essence is bound to the elements of fire.</string>
    <string name="race_description_empty">Each lineage and calling bears its unique virtues and frailties, ready to aid thee in thy grand quest. </string>
